    "basis": "Two-step walking cycle with arms fixed by the load. Leg angles are typical walking values shortened for a loaded stride (estimates; no carry study here gave joint angles). The joint convention has no side-bend key, so side lean is shown as opposite hip abduction. MET from the 2024 Compendium walking table (17019 carrying 23-68 kg at a moderate pace)."
